Nie oczekujemy gwarantowanych wyników — tylko uczciwej szansy, jeżeli muzyka pasuje do Waszych odbiorców.

Pozdrawiam,
Wojciech / Virya`;
    return {subject:reSubject(base.Subject),body,strategy:base.Negotiation_Round==='FINAL'?'Final polite decline + one reciprocal alternative':'First free/editorial counter',free_alternative:'Vertical promo/content exchange',risk_note:'No payment accepted'};
  }
  const body=base.Negotiation_Round==='FINAL'
    ? `${hello}

Thank you for the flexibility and the reduced offer — we genuinely appreciate it. At this stage we cannot allocate budget to paid placement, so we will have to pass on the paid trial.

Before we close the thread, do you ever have an occasional editorial/free slot or would you consider a reciprocal content exchange? We could create a 15–20 second vertical clip naming and tagging ${clean(base.Outlet)}, direct our audience to the playlist or feature, and provide a live clip, EPK, or any clean assets you need.

If paid placement is the only route, absolutely no worries. Thank you again for listening and for the straightforward reply.

Best,
Wojciech / Virya`
    : `${hello}

Thank you for the offer and for listening to ${clean(base.Track)}. We are an independent band and currently focus on editorial and organic opportunities rather than paid placement.

Would you be open to trying one short free/editorial slot or another no-budget collaboration? In return, we can create a 15–20 second vertical clip naming and tagging ${clean(base.Outlet)}, direct our audience to the playlist or feature, and provide a live clip, EPK, or a signed CD if useful.

